{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/o1ne-district-avenew-properties-motor-city","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1487,"crm_id":"8454","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":null,"title":"O1NE District","slug":"o1ne-district-avenew-properties-motor-city","display_address":"Motor City","building_type":["offices"],"completion_year":"2030","developer":"AveNew Properties","price":5000000,"display_price":"5M","lattitude":25.048318003261,"longitude":55.230952007691,"min_bedrooms":0,"max_bedrooms":0,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>O1NE District in <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/dubai-motor-city/\">Motor City</a> is a purposefully designed commercial destination by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-avenew-properties/\">AVENEW Development</a> and KORA Properties Dubai. Comprising six commercial towers, the district introduces Dawn as its first Grade A office tower, offering flexible workspaces within a connected business environment. Designed for productivity and collaboration, it combines premium office spaces with landscaped outdoor areas and lifestyle-focused amenities that support modern businesses.</p><p>O1NE District Dawn brings together architecture, retail, and workplace innovation within a vibrant commercial ecosystem. Connected directly to a shopping mall, the tower features rooftop dining, sky gardens, podium gardens, outdoor co-working spaces, and social gathering areas. With a strategic Motor City location, a 10% down payment, and strong potential for capital appreciation, Dawn at O1NE District by Avenew Development presents an attractive opportunity for businesses and investors alike.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/O1_NE_Dist