m Jumeirah, Al Maktoum International Airport, and Dubai International Airport.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Where is O1NE District located?"},{"id":10462,"answer":"<p>The project is jointly developed by AVENEW Development and Kora Properties Dubai, bringing together expertise in creating modern commercial environments focused on quality, innovation, and long-term value.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Who is developing O1NE District?"},{"id":10463,"answer":"<p>The development features Grade A office spaces ranging from approximately 1,963 sq. ft. to 5,479 sq. ft. within the O1NE Office Tower Motor City, providing flexible workspace solutions for businesses of different sizes.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What types of properties are available?"},{"id":10464,"answer":"<p>Residents and businesses can enjoy rooftop F&amp;B venues, sky gardens, podium gardens, landscaped public plazas, outdoor co-working spaces, social gathering areas, a super lobby, and direct air-conditioned connectivity to the retail mall within the O1NE District commercial project.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What amenities are available at O1NE District?"},{"id":10465,"answer":"<p>The project combines a prime Motor City location, Grade A office specifications, integrated retail, lifestyle-focused amenities, and strong long-term growth potential. These features make O1NE District by Avenew Development an attractive option for investors seeking commercial real estate opportunities.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Why should investors consider O1NE District?"},{"id":10466,"answer":"<p>Yes. The development offers premium Grade A office units with flexible floor plans designed for owner-occupiers and investors. O1NE District offices for sale cater to businesses looking for a modern and connected commercial address.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Are O1NE District offices available for purchase?"},{"id":10467,"answer":"<p>You can explore our latest listings for available office units and connect with the experienced team at Zoya Ventures Real Estate for expert guidance throughout your property purchase journey, from selecting the right office to completing the transaction.</p>","question":"How can I invest in O1NE District?"}],"virtual_tour_url":null,"permit_number":null,"country":"Dubai","documents":null,"future_launch":null,"adroll":0,"ggfx_results":[{"src_url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/O1_NE_District_Motor_City_by_Avenew_Development_Offices_7021cafabf.jpg","src_cftle":"i/O1_NE_District_Motor_City_by_Avenew_Development_Offices_7021cafabf.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/376x/O1_NE_District_Motor_City_by_Avenew_Development_Offices_7021cafabf.webp","format":"webp","transform":"376x","created_at":"2026-07-17 13:00:50.836","updated_at":"2026-07-17 13:00:50.836"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/376x512/O1_NE_District_Motor_City_by_Avenew_Development_Offices_7021cafabf.webp","format":"webp","transform":"376x512","created_at":"2026-07-17 13:00:50.836","updated_at":"2026-07-17 13:00:50.836"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/744x/O1_NE_District_Motor_City_by_Avenew_Development_Offices_7021cafabf.webp","format":"webp","transform":"744x","created_at":"2026-07-17 13:00:50.836","updated_at":"2026-07-17 13:00:50.836"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/1650x/O1_NE_District_Motor_City_by_Avenew_Development_Offices_7021cafabf.webp","format":"webp","transform":"1650x","created_at":"2026-07-17 13:00:50.836","updated_at":"2026-07-17 13:00:50.836"}]},{"src_url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Mobile_408a667de2.jpg","src_cftle":"i/Mobile_408a667de2.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/376x512/Mobile_408a667de2.webp","format":"webp","transform":"376x512","created_at":"2026-07-17 13:00:50.836","updated_at":"2026-07-17 13:00:50.836"},{"url":"https://gg